1
00:00:00,967 --> 00:00:04,104
First, select the “CTA Canvas”

2
00:00:04,104 --> 00:00:07,073
Create “Hotspot Area” and set it as “360-Degree Object Viewer”

3
00:00:07,073 --> 00:00:11,644
You can adjust the “Display Setting” & “Activation Method”

4
00:00:11,644 --> 00:00:17,150
Select the folder in your “Media Library” included all 360 degree product images

5
00:00:17,150 --> 00:00:26,126
You can decide how this feature to be displayed

6
00:00:26,126 --> 00:00:33,199
You can add shadow and stroke of your display as well

7
00:00:33,199 --> 00:00:40,407
Your selected folder should included all 360 degree images in sequence

8
00:00:42,976 --> 00:00:51,551
In preview, you can toggle your window to spin the object in 360 degree
